# Vouched Contributors
#
# Users listed here have been approved to submit pull requests.
# Maintainers and collaborators with write access bypass this check automatically.
#
# Maintainers vouch new contributors by commenting "/vouch" on their
# Vouch Request discussion. The vouch-command workflow updates this file on the
# "vouched" branch; the vouch-check workflow reads it from there, never from a
# pull request branch.
#
# Format: one GitHub username per line, no @ prefix; the workflow appends new entries.
# Prefix with - to denounce; a denounce overrides any vouch line for that name.
# See https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch for details.
